\begin_inset Formula $y(1)=-2$
\end_inset

, dan 
\begin_inset Formula $\dot{y}(1)=-9$
\end_inset

 menghasilkan 
\begin_inset Formula $m=\frac{-2-2}{1-0}=-4$
\end_inset

